---
description: React and Next.js component rules
globs: src/app/**/*.tsx,src/features/**/*.tsx
---
- Default to Server Components. Add "use client" only for interactivity, and push it to the smallest leaf component.
- Fetch data in server components via services, not in useEffect.
- Components are presentational where possible; extract logic into hooks.
- Define props with explicit interfaces. Handle loading, empty, and error states.
- Use Tailwind with consistent spacing. Accessible markup (semantic elements, labels, alt text, keyboard support).
- Show predictions as probabilities with percentages, never as guarantees.